OL,1,Vk4                               G6/9
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGTORIES LEAD LABOUR
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGIN NEW POLLS
OL,4,D
OL,5, A Harris poll published in tomorrow's
OL,6, Daily Express gives the Conservatives
OL,7, a 5% lead over Labour.
OL,9,FThe poll conducted between 21-23 March
OL,10,Fgave the Tories 43% with Labour on 38%,
OL,11,FLib Dems on 15% and others 4%. It is
OL,12,Fsubject to a margin of error of +/-3%.
OL,14,FMeanwhile, a telephone poll by Audience
OL,15,FSelection gives the Tories 40%, Labour
OL,16,F38%, Lib Dems 16% and others 5%. Phone
OL,17,Fpolls are subject to a +/- 4.5% error.
OL,19,FMost recent polls put Labour ahead and
OL,20,Fthe last BBC poll of polls put the
OL,21,FTories on 39% and Labour on 41%.
OL,22,D
OL,23,D]FFromG23-03-92F/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
