OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGAT LEAST 27 KILLED IN
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGNEW YORK PLANE CRASH
OL,4,D
OL,5, Police in New York now say 27 people
OL,6, died in yesterday's crash of a US-Air
OL,7, plane, carrying 51 people, at La
OL,8, Guardia airport.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FThey added that 24 survivors were being
OL,11,Ftreated in local hospitals.
OL,13,FThe plane was taking off for Cleveland
OL,14,Fwhen it veered of a runway and crashed,
OL,15,Fskidding into the icy waters of
OL,16,FFlushing Bay.
OL,18,FInvestigators have recovered the flight
OL,19,Frecorder and are trying to find out
OL,20,Fwhat caused the accident, which
OL,21,Fhappened during a snowstorm.
OL,23,D]FFromG23-03-92F/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
